      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "You're a real killer, Marked One! I wouldn't want to stand in your way. Ever!",
      "JA_current": "お前は最高の殺し屋だな！ お前の前には立ちたいとも思わないね。全く！",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
