      ],
      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "That's a shame. We could really use a fighter like you. I guess we'll have to do it on our own...",
      "JA_current": "それは残念だ。お前のような戦士がいてくれるとありがたいんだが。どうも俺たちだけでやらなきゃならんようだな…。",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
